<v Ralph Fisher>That muscle right there is the one that throws all the bull riders off. When they flex that muscle, the rope just pops right out of their hand, and they're long gone. Yes, you're a good boy. Yeah.
<v Ralph Fisher>那块肌肉正是让所有骑牛者摔下来的地方。当他们弯曲那块肌肉时，绳子就会从他们的手中弹出来，他们就飞出去了。是的，你是好孩子。是的。

00:29:50.120 --> 00:29:52.710
<v Ira Glass>Bulls usually don't even want you near them.
<v Ira Glass>公牛通常甚至不想让你靠近它们。

00:29:52.710 --> 00:29:54.230
<v Ralph Fisher>Come on, buddy.
<v Ralph Fisher>来吧，伙计。

00:29:54.230 --> 00:30:09.710
<v Ira Glass>Now, Ralph Fisher had been around bulls and steer all his life. He'd worked the rodeo as a young man. He'd trained animals as an adult. When he found Chance at an auction, he'd never seen a bull so tame. His kids would climb all over Chance. Chance would nuzzle up to Ralph's wife, Sandra, and lean his head.
<v Ira Glass>拉尔夫·费舍尔一生都在和公牛与阉牛打交道。他年轻时在牛仔竞技表演中工作。他成年后训练过动物。当他在拍卖会上发现“机会”时，他从没见过如此温顺的公牛。他的孩子们会爬在“机会”身上。它会去蹭拉尔夫的妻子桑德拉，靠着她的头。

00:30:09.710 --> 00:30:15.740
<v Sandra Fisher>It really is like having a pet dog or a pet cat, except the size.
<v Sandra Fisher>这真的就像养了一只宠物狗或宠物猫，除了体型大了点。

00:30:15.740 --> 00:30:19.290
<v Ira Glass>But they seem so much less demonstrative, you know?
<v Ira Glass>但它们看起来没那么爱表现，对吧？

00:30:19.290 --> 00:30:20.200
<v Sandra Fisher>Wrong-- [LAUGHS]
<v Sandra Fisher>错—— [笑]

00:30:20.200 --> 00:30:21.630
<v Ira Glass>Really?
<v Ira Glass>真的吗？

00:30:21.630 --> 00:30:29.130
<v Sandra Fisher>That's wrong.
<v Sandra Fisher>那是错的。

00:30:29.130 --> 00:30:40.210
<v Ira Glass>I don't know if Ralph and Sandra would agree with this, but I think everything that went bad, all the trouble that eventually unfolded, it all came because they were blinded by their feelings.
<v Ira Glass>我不知道拉尔夫和桑德拉是否同意这一点，但我认为所有变坏的事情，所有最终发生的麻烦，都是因为他们被自己的感情蒙蔽了。

00:30:40.210 --> 00:30:50.990
<v Announcer>With the world's largest Herd of saddle-broke tame Texas Longhorns and Brahmans, Ralph Fisher's photo animals are sure to be a crowd-pleaser at your corporate gathering, convention, sales meeting, or even at your own private party.
<v Announcer>拥有世界上最大的鞍下温顺德克萨斯长角牛和婆罗门牛群，拉尔夫·费舍尔的摄影动物一定会成为您的企业聚会、会议、销售会议甚至私人派对上的亮点。

00:30:50.990 --> 00:31:07.890
<v Ira Glass>Ralph and Sandra have a family business taking pictures of people standing next to or on top of animals at barbecues, parties, the occasional presidential inaugural ball. And Chance was the star. This is their promotional video. They did dozens of shots of people sitting on Chance, one after another.
<v Ira Glass>拉尔夫和桑德拉有一家家庭企业，专门在烧烤、派对、偶尔的总统就职舞会上，拍人们站在动物旁边或骑在动物身上的照片。“机会”就是明星。这是他们的宣传视频。他们给人们骑在“机会”身上的镜头拍了几十次，一张接一张。

00:31:07.890 --> 00:31:18.950
<v Announcer>With $1 million liability insurance, beautiful tame animals, and state of the art photo equipment, we furnish your clients and guests with a lasting memory of your Texas event.
<v Announcer>拥有100万美元的责任保险，美丽温顺的动物，以及最先进的摄影设备，我们为您的客户和客人提供德克萨斯活动的持久回忆。

00:31:18.950 --> 00:31:32.860
<v Ira Glass>Because of the business, Chance is possibly the most photographed bull who's ever lived. Chance met Ashley Judd and Roger Clements, Mother Theresa and Sonny Bono-- those were separate meetings-- Hitman Hearns, Sugar Ray Leonard, Dan Rather. Chance did the Letterman Show.
<v Ira Glass>因为这项业务，“机会”可能是历史上被拍摄最多的公牛。它见过艾什莉·贾德和罗杰·克莱门斯、特蕾莎修女和桑尼·波诺——那些是单独的会面——希特曼·赫恩斯、舒格·雷·伦纳德、丹·拉瑟。它还上过大卫·莱特曼秀。

00:31:32.860 --> 00:31:38.650
<v David Letterman>You know, this animal, certain parts of this animal, it looks like he's shoplifting sporting goods.
<v David Letterman>你知道，这只动物的某些部分，看起来它像是在商店里偷窃运动器材。

00:31:38.650 --> 00:31:40.870
<v Ira Glass>Chance was in a movie with Vince Vaughn.
<v Ira Glass>“机会”还和文斯·沃恩演过电影。

00:31:40.870 --> 00:31:44.240
<v Man 1>That sure is a handsome bull.
<v Man 1>那确实是一头帅气的公牛。

00:31:44.240 --> 00:31:50.150
<v Man 2>Yes, sir. That's about the handsomest bull I've seen in all my days of cattle ranching.
<v Man 2>是的，先生。那是我一生放牧牛群以来见过的最帅气的公牛。

00:31:50.150 --> 00:32:05.710
<v Ira Glass>In the movie, Jeremy Davies plays a guy who doesn't talk to people, but does talk to Chance, which all builds to this climactic scene where, for reasons that are not exactly clear, Kate Capshaw castrates Chance in the middle of the night in a driving rainstorm, just to prove a point.
<v Ira Glass>在电影中，杰里米·戴维斯饰演一个不与人交流，但与“机会”说话的人，这一切构建了那个高潮场景，由于原因不太明确，凯特·卡普肖在深夜大雨中阉割了“机会”，仅仅是为了证明一个观点。

00:32:05.710 --> 00:32:09.140
<v Delilah Ashford Potts>Now, you watch this, because I'm only gonna show you once.
<v Delilah Ashford Potts>现在，你看好，因为我只给你演示一次。

